Output docs/scope.mp4
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Iosevka"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1120
Set Height 530
Set Padding 10
Set Framerate 25
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "dotamp --silent"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "/"
Sleep 400ms
Type "play deep"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Right
Sleep 3s
Type "v"
Sleep 14s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
